<title>USA: Ceridian Corp to acquire Partnership Group.</title>
<headline>Ceridian Corp to acquire Partnership Group.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceridian Corp said Thursday it has agreed in principle to acquire  The Partnership Group Inc, a Philadelphia-based provider of dependent care services.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition is expected to close within 30 days, Ceridian, an employee assistance programs provider, said in a news release.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
